1
00:00:00,666 --> 00:00:02,000
reject reasonable projects due to personal feelings

2
00:00:02,066 --> 00:00:03,233
nor will I use personal ties

3
00:00:03,233 --> 00:00:04,666
to accept projects with unclear risks

4
00:00:04,766 --> 00:00:07,500
Will you still come back in the future

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,666
If it's just for dinner

6
00:00:09,666 --> 00:00:10,600
I will consider it

7
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,600
But if you want me to

8
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,000
deal with Su Yurou's emotions

9
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:16,366
handle the Gu family's pressure for the Su family

10
00:00:16,366 --> 00:00:17,433
or make me compromise

11
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,566
I won't come

12
00:00:18,966 --> 00:00:20,233
Okay Mingyao

13
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,700
At the Su Group I want to

14
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:22,466
reserve a position for you

15
00:00:22,466 --> 00:00:24,166
It's not to make you serve the Su family

16
00:00:24,166 --> 00:00:25,433
It's just that you are truly capable

17
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Your judgment on contracts and projects

18
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,600
is better than I expected

19
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,966
If there are suitable projects in the future

20
00:00:28,966 --> 00:00:30,433
I can participate as a professional

21
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,200
But not as a way to compensate your daughter

22
00:00:32,466 --> 00:00:34,166
Nor as a bridge to the Fu Group

23
00:00:34,266 --> 00:00:35,066
Alright

24
00:00:35,266 --> 00:00:37,033
You can get to know me again

25
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,966
But stop trying to dictate who I am

26
00:00:46,433 --> 00:00:47,233
Ah

27
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:48,900
Feeling sad

28
00:00:50,066 --> 00:00:50,466
Yes

29
00:00:50,466 --> 00:00:53,166
A little but mostly I feel relieved

30
00:00:53,666 --> 00:00:55,366
They are willing to get to know me again

31
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,800
I can give them a chance

32
00:00:57,433 --> 00:00:59,300
But my life

33
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,000
no longer needs their approval
